NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_YOUR_KEY
# No service-role, database password or AI key is needed in Next.js for lobbies.
# The deployed Edge Function reads its administrative key from Supabase secrets.
# Real rounds: add NVIDIA_API_KEY (recommended for NVIDIA Build trials) or
# OPENAI_API_KEY in Supabase function secrets, NOT in this file.
# Optional server secrets: BOT_PROVIDER=nvidia|openai, NVIDIA_BOT_MODEL, OPENAI_BOT_MODEL.
# Owner dashboard: WTB_ADMIN_BRIDGE_TOKEN is a private Next.js server secret.
# Initial installation generates it locally and registers only its hash in Supabase.
# Never prefix it with NEXT_PUBLIC_ or paste it into chat. See docs/ADMIN.md.
